## Overview

Morva is a library of live generative visuals made with p5.js, three.js and GLSL. You pick an entry, shape it with plain controls, set some type over it, and export it as an image, a video, an embed or standalone code. Each entry also explains the technique behind it and where it comes from.

The name comes from *morph*: shapes that keep changing. I designed and built all of it, from the brand to the effects engine.

{% stats %}
{% stat value="56" label="Entries across Generative, Type and Image" /%}
